<title>UK: Mitsubishi Corp unit sets 50 bln yen bond.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Corp unit sets 50 bln yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by sole lead manager Daiwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MITSUBISHI CORP FINANCE PLC</p>
<p> AMT    50 BLN YEN    COUPON     1.5	 MATURITY    13.JUL.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.74    PAY DATE  S-13.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  12.5 BP   REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   GROSS UP</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
